    "body": "fix on issue/1904-first-4axis-part · PR #2135 · pinned by `the_first_4axis_part_posts_its_indexed_program`, `each_flat_posts_the_same_cut_after_its_index`, `the_committed_project_posts_the_committed_program` (`crates/app/tests/first_4axis_part.rs`) and `FirstFourAxisPart` (`site/tests/test_first_4axis_part.py`) · merges when reviewed\n\nThis PR is the 3+1 indexed part only (\"Your first 4-axis part\"). It uses `Refs #1904`, and this issue stays open.\n\n- The continuous 4-axis walkthrough is not written. `tormach.cps` refuses an A that changes inside an operation, and #796 must give the PathPilot Hub results first.\n- The posted program has no PathPilot Hub run yet. The program is `examples/first-4axis-part.nc`. Please record the Hub run here.\n- New issue #2133: a Tool axis A of 180 degrees is refused with no reason, and the plane of the A 0 B 180 face has X and Y exchanged.\n",
